  "_about": "Achievements and the rewards they unlock (auras, avatar animations, Slope ball skins, site themes and Motocross bike paint jobs). The server checks these rules before you can wear a reward, and the website shows them. Rules: {\"level\": n}, {\"ach\": id}, {\"achs\": [ids]} (all of them), or a stat test like {\"stat\": \"dash.wins\", \"gte\": 1} (gte, gt, lte; \"stat\" can be a list, which is summed). Events count the stats in their \"track\" map separately while they're on (as ev.<event>.<name>), with the same add/max/min the game uses.",
